* Encoding: UTF-8.

WEIGHT BY peso.

FILTER OFF.
USE ALL.
EXECUTE.


**Comparación de medias de PMS, BITH, Pob Rel, Pob Severa

T-TEST GROUPS=PMS_proxy(0 1)
  /MISSING=ANALYSIS
  /VARIABLES=TOT_FIES_SIMPLE
  /ES DISPLAY(TRUE)
  /CRITERIA=CI(.95).

T-TEST GROUPS=BITH_proxy(0 1)
  /MISSING=ANALYSIS
  /VARIABLES=TOT_FIES_SIMPLE
  /ES DISPLAY(TRUE)
  /CRITERIA=CI(.95).

T-TEST GROUPS=Pob_relativa(0 1)
  /MISSING=ANALYSIS
  /VARIABLES=TOT_FIES_SIMPLE
  /ES DISPLAY(TRUE)
  /CRITERIA=CI(.95).

T-TEST GROUPS=Pob_severa(0 1)
  /MISSING=ANALYSIS
  /VARIABLES=TOT_FIES_SIMPLE
  /ES DISPLAY(TRUE)
  /CRITERIA=CI(.95).



**Frecuencias de puntuaciones 0, 1,2,3...8 (útil para gráficos)

CROSSTABS
  /TABLES=PMS_proxy BITH_proxy Pob_relativa Pob_severa BY TOT_FIES_SIMPLE
  /FORMAT=AVALUE TABLES
  /CELLS=COUNT
  /COUNT ROUND CELL.




* Proxys AROPE * Puntuación directa (simple) FIES

CTABLES
  /VLABELS VARIABLES=PMS_proxy BITH_proxy Pob_relativa Pob_severa TOT_FIES_SIMPLE DISPLAY=LABEL
  /TABLE PMS_proxy + BITH_proxy + Pob_relativa + Pob_severa BY TOT_FIES_SIMPLE [MEAN]
  /CATEGORIES VARIABLES=PMS_proxy BITH_proxy Pob_relativa Pob_severa ORDER=A KEY=VALUE EMPTY=INCLUDE    
  /CRITERIA CILEVEL=95.




*Regresion lineal punto 0-8 y tres indicadores AROPE proxy

REGRESSION
  /MISSING LISTWISE
  /STATISTICS COEFF OUTS R ANOVA
  /CRITERIA=PIN(.05) POUT(.10)
  /NOORIGIN 
  /DEPENDENT TOT_FIES_SIMPLE
  /METHOD=ENTER PMS_proxy BITH_proxy Pob_relativa.


*Proxys AROPE * Prevalencias rangos FAO

CTABLES
  /VLABELS VARIABLES=PMS_proxy BITH_proxy Pob_relativa Pob_severa P_moderada_pct_FAO 
    P_grave_pct_FAO DISPLAY=LABEL
  /TABLE PMS_proxy + BITH_proxy + Pob_relativa + Pob_severa BY P_moderada_pct_FAO [MEAN 
    PCTPAREN40.2] + P_grave_pct_FAO [MEAN PCTPAREN40.2]
  /CATEGORIES VARIABLES=PMS_proxy BITH_proxy Pob_relativa Pob_severa ORDER=A KEY=VALUE EMPTY=INCLUDE    
  /CRITERIA CILEVEL=95.

